# Python Web Development Guidelines

<purpose>
Follow all of these guidelines when programming a web-app in python!
</purpose>

**Web Development (Python):**

151. **Use frameworks like Flask, FastAPI, or Django as needed**.
152. **Keep views/routes slim—delegate logic to services or helpers**.
153. **Validate inputs using `pydantic`, `marshmallow`, or forms**.
154. **Use ORM efficiently—beware of N+1 queries**.
155. **Sanitize and escape all user inputs/outputs**.
156. **Use async frameworks (FastAPI, Starlette) for high concurrency**.
157. **Configure proper logging and error handling**.
158. **Write integration tests for endpoints and edge cases**.
159. **Use `.env` for config—never hardcode secrets**.
160. **Deploy with gunicorn/uvicorn, and reverse-proxy with nginx**.
